type: dataset
title: "Who Can Read This? Scientific Abstract Jargon Survey Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: Beiden
    given-names: Ron
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
url: "https://github.com/RonBeiden/who-can-read-this-survey-data"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "Expert-rated minimum reader expertise for 60 scientific abstracts in genetics/bioinformatics/biomedical, NLP, and HCI/IUI. Includes 299 ratings, original explanations, vote distributions, and six traditional readability baselines. Third-party abstract texts are excluded from the dataset license."
